   - Test FASTFLOW on alltoall workloads (`a2a_128n_1MiB_k1/k2/k8/k16.cm`)
   - Possibly improve cwnd recovery (FCTs still 30-90x slower than ideal)
   - Investigate why 22/100 flows still stall on 100-deg 1024KiB
   - Step 2: Wire FASTFLOW+EQDS+MCC mode end-to-end
   - Step 3: Wire connection_matrix coflow_id parsing + CoflowRegistry
   - Step 4: Validate RA-QA ablation
   - Update plot_swift_results.py for fastflow output
