8. Current Work:
   Just completed making the FASTFLOW protocol functionally work across all tested incast configurations. The latest test sweep showed:
   ```
   8-deg 128KiB:   8/8 flows,   max_fct=30.9us
   8-deg 1024KiB:  8/8 flows,   max_fct=23.7ms
